<title>UK: S&amp;P affirms Scottish Life financial strength.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms Scottish Life financial strength.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it affirmed its A plus financial strength rating of The Scottish Life Assurance Company, a company positioned in the second tier of British life offices and specialising in pensions business.</p>
</text>
